   794	- Priority: Should-Have (Wendy buy-in achieved but final leadership confirmation pending)
   795	- Users Impacted: Wendy (PM Manager), PMs, installation coordinators, external contractors
   796	- Business Impact: Formalizes PM assignments, tracks field activities, improves project coordination
