  1677	
  1678	# SECTION 9: FIELD SERVICE APP DEPLOYMENT
  1679	
  1680	## 9.1 Your Business Requirements
  1681	
  1682	**REQ-028: Deploy Field Service app for PMs and contractors (tablet/mobile) (ALIGNS)**
  1683	
  1684	The Field Service app is the central mobile platform for all field operations. PMs and contractors access it on tablets (primary platform) and can also use mobile phones (responsive design). The app provides real-time access to work order information, enables time tracking, punch list management, photo/signature collection, and communication without requiring constant office system access.
  1685	
  1686	**REQ-029: Enable check-in with geological stamping to confirm on-site presence (ACCOMMODATE)**
  1687	
  1688	When PMs or contractors arrive at a job site, they check in using the Field Service app. The check-in includes geological stamping (GPS verification that they're actually at the specified location). This creates accountability and provides proof that the PM/contractor was on-site at the time they claim. This data is valuable for manager oversight and also helpful for resolving disputes about whether work was actually performed.
  1689	
  1690	**REQ-030: Support photo attachment, signatures, and document collection (ALIGNS)**
  1691	
  1692	The Field Service app includes document collection capabilities: photos, signatures (e.g., client sign-off on completed work), attachments, and other documents. This creates complete documentation of site conditions, work completed, and client acknowledgment in a single mobile platform.
  1693	
  1694	**REQ-031: Enable multi-resource time entry from work order events (ALIGNS)**
  1695	
  1696	If multiple resources are working on a single work order event (e.g., PM + 2 contractors), users can enter time once and apply it to all resources simultaneously. This simplifies time entry for group work and ensures consistency. The system can also add temporary resources to a work order event if additional support is needed.
  1697	
  1698	**Requirements Classification:**
  1699	- Type: Functional - Field operations platform
  1700	- Priority: Must-Have
  1701	- Users Impacted: PMs, installation contractors, clients (receiving photos/documentation)
  1702	- Business Impact: Provides central field operations platform, enables field-based documentation, improves real-time communication
  1703	
