  1706	## 9.2 Current State Process
  1707	
  1708	**PROCESS:** Manual Field Operations (Current State)
  1709	
  1710	**TRIGGER:** PM or contractor assigned to work order event
  1711	
  1712	**CURRENT STEPS:**
  1713	1. PM receives work order assignment via email
  1714	2. Searches for project details in various places (email, Core system, shared drives)
  1715	3. Navigates to job site with address from email or manual notes
  1716	4. Arrives at site, no check-in system
  1717	5. Takes photos on personal phone or tablet
  1718	6. Documents work in physical notes or on paper
  1719	7. May take signatures on tablet using separate signature app
  1720	8. Returns to office
