   767	### 🔴 Critical Priority - Must be answered to proceed
   768	
   769	#### GAP-001: Scheduling & Resource Management Approach (REQ-032, REQ-033, REQ-034)
   770	**Question**: How sophisticated should resource management be? PM task lists? Resource visualizer? Account manager pre-quote tracking?  
   771	**Missing Information**: Explicit decisions on task management approach, resource visualizer design, account manager integration  
   772	**Business Impact**: Affects entire PM and account manager workflow. Wendy currently maintains manual tracking. Could range from no custom development (saved searches only) to significant custom resource visualizer. Employee resistance risk if too detailed. Decision impacts project timeline and budget.  
   773	**Who Can Answer**: Wendy (primary user), Kimmy (account manager needs), Matt (sophistication decision), Marcus (capabilities)  
   774	**How to Get Answer**: Dedicated 2-hour design session (see Session 1 above)  
   775	**Timeline Impact**: Blocking - Cannot complete requirements map or proceed with scheduling configuration until decided
   776	
