   596	- PC/PM uses custom groupings in smart table to organize purchase orders by installation phase
   597	- PC/PM coordinates with installation manager through system to discuss availability
   598	- After confirming dates with client, work order created in NetSuite with purchase order groups
   599	- Work order includes all relevant files \(no duplication needed\)
   600	- Multiple work order events created for phased installation \(e\.g\., 40%/40%/20%\)
   601	- Installation manager schedules work order events
