     1	# Cross-Area Decisions Index
     2	
     3	A single-source-of-truth index of decisions and capabilities that span more than one process area. Used to ensure consistency when sections are drafted in different sessions or by different authors.
     4	
     5	**Maintenance rule:** When a section surfaces a dependency on another area, add a row here *before* moving on. When a section locks a decision that other sections will inherit, mark it locked here so downstream sections cite it correctly.
