   298	|--------|-------------|---------------------------|----------|
   299	| REQ-002 | Implement Advanced Receiving tool with drag-and-drop bin functionality | Orion Advanced Receiving Tool (custom Orion innovation) | ACCOMMODATE |
   300	| REQ-003 | Configure one receiving bin per third-party warehouse location | NetSuite Bin Management | ALIGNS |
   301	| REQ-004 | Configure damaged inventory bin per location to quarantine damaged product | NetSuite Bin Management with allocation prevention rules | ALIGNS |
   302	| REQ-005 | Configure duplicate/overage inventory bin per location | NetSuite Bin Management | ALIGNS |
   303	
