   978	
   979	PMs are paid/costed on a flat rate basis (not hourly). Each PM has an internal rate (what it costs the company when that PM logs time—used for project costing) and an external rate (what clients are billed for PM time on a SOW). Some clients have negotiated different PM rates under their service agreements.
