  1912	
  1913	**REQ-029: Field Service App Geological Check-In with GPS Stamping**
  1914	
  1915	**Scope:** Custom Orion feature implementing check-in with GPS location verification
  1916	
  1917	**High-Level Design Approach:**
  1918	- Check-in button on event detail screen
  1919	- On tap, app captures current GPS location
  1920	- Records location, timestamp, user ID
  1921	- Compares captured location to event address (within X miles accuracy)
  1922	- If within tolerance, check-in successful
  1923	- If outside tolerance, warning: "You appear to be [X miles] from scheduled location"
  1924	- Check-in data stored with event for audit trail
  1925	
  1926	**Benefits:**
  1927	- Accountability for on-site presence
  1928	- Prevents false check-ins from office
  1929	- Creates proof for dispute resolution
  1930	- Manager oversight of PM locations in real-time (optional dashboard)
  1931	
  1932	**Dependencies:**
  1933	- Mobile device GPS capability (all modern tablets/phones have this)
  1934	- Location data storage in NetSuite
  1935	- Accuracy tolerance definition (how close to address is required?)
